        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>复数练习题（含手写批注）</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #fdfdfa;\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #222;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 30px 34px 40px 34px;\n    max-width: 546px;\n  }\n  .qblock {\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .stem {\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .options {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-start;\n    margin: 6px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .options > div {\n    flex: 0 0 25%;\n    padding-left: 4px;\n  }\n  .options.opt-indent > div:first-child {\n    padding-left: 12px;\n  }\n  .hand {\n    color: #1a4fd6;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", cursive;\n  }\n  .hand-red {\n    color: #d3282a;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", cursive;\n  }\n  .circled {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1.5px solid #d3282a;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: #1a4fd6;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    width: 1.35em;\n    height: 1.35em;\n    line-height: 1.3em;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", cursive;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #bbb;\n    color: #777;\n    font-family: sans-serif;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n  }\n  .work-1 {\n    margin: 10px 0 18px 150px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 150px;\n  }\n  .work-2 {\n    margin: 14px 0 18px 190px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n  }\n  .work-3 {\n    margin: 14px 0 10px 175px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n  .rot {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -110px;\n    top: 42px;\n    transform: rotate(-28deg);\n    color: #1a4fd6;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", cursive;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .boxed-red {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1.4px solid #d3282a;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 1px 8px;\n  }\n  .sep {\n    border: 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid #e2e2e2;\n    margin: 18px 0;\n  }\n  .diagram-wrap {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    top: -8px;\n  }\n  .frac {\n    display: inline-block;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .frac .num {\n    display: block;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;\n    padding: 0 3px;\n  }\n  .frac .den {\n    display: block;\n    padding: 0 3px;\n  }\n  .arrow-note {\n    color: #d3282a;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", cursive;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<!-- 第一题 -->\n<div class=\"qblock\">\n  <div class=\"stem\">\n    $A$，$B$分别是复数$z_1$，$z_2$在复平面内对应的点，$O$是原点，若$|z_1 + z_2| = |z_1 - z_2|$，则三角形$AOB$一定是（<span class=\"circled\">B</span>）．\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"options\">\n    <div>A．等腰三角形</div>\n    <div>B．直角三角形</div>\n    <div>C．等边三角形</div>\n    <div>D．等腰直角三角形</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"work-1\">\n    <div class=\"rot\">[illegible]</div>\n\n    <div class=\"diagram-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:160px;height:80px;\">[Diagram: 手绘平行四边形/矢量图，标注 A、B、O、z<sub>1</sub>+z<sub>2</sub>、z<sub>1</sub>-z<sub>2</sub>，右上方]</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hand\">\n      ∵复数的几何意义得<br>\n      $\\overrightarrow{OA}$，$\\overrightarrow{OB}$ 表示 $z_1$，$z_2$<br>\n      $|z_1 + z_2| = |z_1 - z_2|$<br>\n      ∵由平面向量的加减法则得<br>\n      <span style=\"margin-left:34px;\">以$\\overrightarrow{OA}$，$\\overrightarrow{OB}$为邻边所作的平行四边形的对角线相等</span><br>\n      ∴此平行四边形为矩形<br>\n      ∴$\\triangle OAB$为直角三角形\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<hr class=\"sep\">\n\n<!-- 第二题 -->\n<div class=\"qblock\">\n  <div class=\"stem\">\n    已知<span class=\"hand-red\"></span>为虚数单位，则$i + i^2 + i^3 + \\cdots + i^{2019}$等于（<span class=\"circled\">D</span>）．\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"options opt-indent\">\n    <div>A．i</div>\n    <div>B．1</div>\n    <div>C．$-i$</div>\n    <div>D．$-1$</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"work-2 hand\">\n    $i + i^2 + i^3 + \\cdots + i^{2019}$<br>\n    $= i + i^2 + i^3 + \\cdots + i^{504\\times4+3}$<br>\n    <span class=\"boxed-red\">$= i^{2017} + i^{2018} + i^{2019} = 0$</span><br>\n    <span class=\"hand-red\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:6px;\">周期为4，四个数内和为0</span><br>\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:12px;\">∴原式$= i + i^2 + i^3$</span><br>\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:60px;\">$= -1$</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<hr class=\"sep\">\n\n<!-- 第三题 -->\n<div class=\"qblock\">\n  <div class=\"stem\">\n    若复数$z$满足$(3 - 4i)z = |4 + 3i|$，则$z$的虚部为（<span class=\"circled\">B</span>）．\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"options opt-indent\">\n    <div>A．$-4$</div>\n    <div>B．$-\\dfrac{4}{5}$</div>\n    <div>C．$-4i$</div>\n    <div>D．$-\\dfrac{4}{5}i$</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"work-3 hand\">\n    ∵$(3 - 4i)z = |4 + 3i|$<br>\n    ∴$z = \\dfrac{|4 + 3i|}{3 - 4i} = \\dfrac{5}{3 - 4i}$\n    <span class=\"arrow-note\">→先考虑求出 $z$</span><br>\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:40px;\">$= \\dfrac{5(3 + 4i)}{(3 - 4i)(3 + 4i)}$</span>\n    <span class=\"arrow-note\">→分母、分子同时乘 $3-4i$<br>的共轭复数</span><br>\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:40px;\">$= \\dfrac{3}{5} + \\dfrac{4}{5}i$</span><br>\n    <span class=\"hand-red\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:60px;\">虚部</span><br>\n    ∴$z = \\dfrac{3}{5} + \\boxed{\\dfrac{4}{5}}$\n    <span style=\"margin-left:14px;\">∴$z$的虚部为$\\dfrac{4}{5}$</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
